# supabase/ is excluded EXCEPT functions/_shared, which the browser build
# genuinely needs: services/ww3CacheClient.ts imports its wave types and
# constants from supabase/functions/_shared/ww3. With the whole tree excluded,
# Vercel's checkout was missing that module and tsc failed the build with
# TS2307 "Cannot find module" — while building fine here, where the file
# obviously exists. Every production deploy has failed since 2026-07-24, when
# this ignore file and ww3CacheClient landed on the same day.
#
# Written as `supabase/*` rather than `supabase/`, deliberately: gitignore
# semantics (which this file follows) cannot re-include anything beneath a
# directory that is itself excluded, so the negations below would be silently
# inert. Each level has to be opened before the next can be re-included.
supabase/*
!supabase/functions
supabase/functions/*
!supabase/functions/_shared

# Large local data caches; production map/chart samples live under public/
tiles/
